| TC-01 | Happy Path | Valid input payload | 200 OK / Target screen rendered |
| TC-02 | Edge / Boundary | Empty string / Max length limit | Field validation error triggers |
| TC-03 | Negative | Invalid auth / Network failure | 401 Unauthorized / Graceful retry |

### 2. 🧱 Page Object Model (POM) / Helper Layer
Clean, modular class encapsulating locators, action methods, and route mocks.

### 3. 🧪 Runnable Test Suite
Fully executable test file containing parameterized scenarios, assertions, and hooks (`beforeEach`/`fixture`).

### 4. 🚀 CI/CD Execution Command
Ready-to-run CLI commands for headless execution, parallel runs, and reporting (e.g., `npx playwright test` or `pytest -v --tags=smoke`).

